At Cornell in my fraternity, my house name was Hubble because I was so good at finding a party.

35
00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:27.160
That was like a powerful space telescope.

36
00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:28.720
Okay.

37
00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:29.700
Okay.

38
