He's so much fun.

62
00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:36.000
So is Mindy.

63
00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:37.300
I can't wait to see this show.

64
00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:38.340
The reviews are amazing.

65
00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:42.020
Yes, once again, guys, Sex Lives of College Girls.

66
00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:43.260
And thank you, Mindy.

67
00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:43.900
We love you.

68
00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:44.660
Love you.

69
