425
00:20:32.340 --> 00:20:33.640
It was the very first one.

426
00:20:33.780 --> 00:20:34.680
That's cool.

427
00:20:35.240 --> 00:20:36.240
That's amazing.

428
00:20:36.560 --> 00:20:38.120
Go us for doing that.

429
00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:41.460
And you know, the show Mindy's referring to is Never Have I Ever.

