00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:54.380
So did I.

434
00:20:55.880 --> 00:20:57.560
So did everyone who wasn't 17.

435
00:20:57.940 --> 00:20:58.640
Oh my God.

436
00:20:58.780 --> 00:21:01.720
And they were so cute and they love The Office so much.

437
00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:02.420
Oh my gosh.

438
00:21:02.520 --> 00:21:04.120
They were so starstruck by you, Angela.

