446
00:21:18.280 --> 00:21:19.060
Immediately.

447
00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:25.120
She is so like effervescent and open and just, wow, what a find.

448
00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:25.800
What a find.

449
00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:26.050
Thank you.

