462
00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:04.960
It's just, you should know what it's meant to people.

463
00:22:05.100 --> 00:22:12.380
We had a lot of people write in about having their community seen in a, in, in this mainstream

464
00:22:12.380 --> 00:22:13.600
