465
00:22:13.700 --> 00:22:14.420
It's, it's really moving.

466
00:22:14.420 --> 00:22:14.780
Oh, wow.

467
00:22:15.140 --> 00:22:15.900
That's so nice.

468
00:22:16.040 --> 00:22:19.900
I mean, you know, the, one of the harder things about when you write the Diwali episode

469
00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:22.620
is like, we couldn't believe that Greg said yes.

