00:22:22.740 --> 00:22:25.200
Cause normally we would do like a Halloween episode at that time of year.

471
00:22:25.300 --> 00:22:26.120
Cause it's the end of October.

472
00:22:26.520 --> 00:22:32.140
But then I, when he said yes, I had to kind of confront the fact that I'm Indian American.

473
00:22:32.500 --> 00:22:37.960
I don't know very much about the holiday and that that experience of being Indian American

474
00:22:37.960 --> 00:22:41.860
