00:23:07.780 --> 00:23:08.160
Yes.

484
00:23:08.340 --> 00:23:08.820
Yeah, exactly.

485
00:23:09.240 --> 00:23:11.500
And the music part, she's really excited about that.

486
00:23:11.860 --> 00:23:12.160
Yeah.

